OL,3,GNEWSAGirl dragged under van in 'worst
OL,4,Anightmare' crash raises thousands for
OL,5,Arescuers
OL,6,
OL,7,FA seven-year-old who was left "fighting
OL,8,Ffor life" in a coma for five days after
OL,9,Fbeing dragged under a van while riding
OL,10,Fher bike has been recognised for
OL,11,Fhelping to raise #65,000 for Wales Air
OL,12,FAmbulance.
OL,14,FAt four years old, Gracie Kinnear from
OL,15,FCarmarthen was playing outside with
OL,16,Ffriends during the school holidays when
OL,17,Fa van driver crashed into her, leaving
OL,18,Fher with life-threatening injuries.
OL,20,F"We were unsure of whether our little
OL,21,Fgirl would survive," said her mum,
OL,22,FEmma.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
